# Plan 195: the test environment's config is committed on purpose. It holds no
# real credential — a local loopback database with a throwaway password, a
# test-only AUTH_SECRET, and deliberately NO mail or model API keys — and the
# whole point of it is that the test environment is reproducible from a clone.
!.env.test

